  "acceptance": [
    "The whole-corpus agreement guard runs in required CI on develop and fails when the two validators are made to differ",
    "On published-results, a throwaway pull request that edits a vendored rule file and adds one bundle path (so the workflow fires) is rejected by the guard list; the pull request is then closed",
    "The drift check fails when the registry gains a scale that the data file lacks",
    "published-results validates the current corpus with the new validator"
